{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1549423-illuminated-blood-proximus-now-on-the-storytellers-vault","id":1549423,"title":"Illuminated Blood: Proximus now on the Storytellers Vault!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-03-18T17:13:11-07:00","id":1549423,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon1.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Illuminated Blood: Proximus now on the Storytellers Vault!","content":"<img width=\"281\" height=\"365\" data-align=\"left\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/515654.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/515654.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/images/1/515654.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_left js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <b>Illuminated Blood: Proximus</b> is out now on the Storytellers Vault, for Mage: the Awakening!<br /> <br /> The Supernal bleeds into everything within the Fallen World, so it's no surprise that it makes its way into literal bloodlines. Proximi, lineages of magically touched mortals, grow into vast Dynasties of magical power, lacking the enlightenment of the Awakened but making up for it with innate abilities passed down through generations.<br /> <br /> <b>Illuminated Blood: Proximus</b> explores these lineages, providing options for players and resources for Storytellers. It contains:<br /> \u2022 Expanded character creation rules for Proximi.<br /> \u2022 Optional Rules to expand their utility and enhance their powers.<br /> \u2022 New Merits unique to Proximi.<br /> \u2022 Four Illuminated Dynasties watched over by Awakened Orders.<br /> \u2022 Four anomalous Dynasties born of unique sources and scattered lineages.<br /> \u2022 Eight NPCs \u2014 one for each new and updated Dynasty.<br /> <br /> <br /> Find it here on the Vault: <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/515654/Illuminated-Blood-Proximus?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/515654/Illuminated-Blood-Proximus</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/themes/stvault/images/affiliatebanner4.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Christopher%20Falco&amp;affiliate_id=259490\" target=\"_blank\">Storytellers' Vault supplements (WoD, CoD)</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FalconianP\" target=\"_blank\">My Patreon! (CofD bonuses include: Fae Sorcery/Technomancy for Vampires, Quick Conversion for Inferno, and more!)</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1130-falco1029","name":"falco1029","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1130_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1045"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-22T00:47:44-07:00","id":1549495,"title":"","content":"While I like Mage I am not a veteran player but I do love stories with a dynastic angle in various forms so this looks pretty sweet to me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachme